<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexico deployed 450 troops to Matamoros after a violent weekend that killed six people, including a US citizen. The government also instituted a nationwide ban on cellphones in schools, while parents protest the measure citing safety concerns linked to the violence. An ICE officer was released on bond after being indicted for running over an undocumented Mexican immigrant. Two people were killed when a small plane crashed shortly after takeoff in Mexico. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE9LbHJTQ2xBMmVHaldLaDE1eUFiNnNocDdSQkZRd0dOQkdmTDFNUHZmY0lxbnNuZ19RaWYtQ3o4MlVDejlvXzFvVThrQlNxcGRkTzBOVExLMFNfVENkdTVrRGZzR3phTEdjS3hEUWk0X1NjeFRuejNPOFU5RQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE54RmFYMXExS0NodS1pZnNBWko5bEhIS3FPVkJvZkpPS2J2MXd6RjNqaWdOVlF6dVhsZVlDdXU5a3JLWm1WY2RjcldWMjJfNjJtNHdXS195bmJvLVFybnR1ajBwb0lJRGRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPNFJnYUpGM01zT0lidWI1dV9MT0tycHFqd1k3Y3dKd21Yd1NzVVF0VXBrNTIwLXNiRVdVelc3ZTBUTkFERkxqcUhBa3FfN00tVnN0SENDaG5hQTlBRENlV2Q1UHNmdnJ1NzlsYzB3Y3pJaVBPRXdEZ2x4TFhTSVcxLWtkS0c4eHk3S0ZiRjNMdVIzVENqQzRPay1ZSGdXb3hTRERFTkhR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQalhIMTlKY05MMmRETDNtclpQV1B5TFh2WXB1bUc2Wi1BcDZrdEhKZndpdV83Y2t3M1dKbmlUeDRYZnROMHI4alBJYkFjVi1mZzg4bGpOTXF6emRBNVNTdkE2MHkxRTJMNndZN0NVOHo2dnFYbUs5M0E1WjRGbWtLZnJ4R3NKcHFxUWVMeUFTeUZFeG9Kd184c0YzMjlaSFhVM2JMVnNkb0VWd1NiQnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;KTSM 9 News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNNlYweVQ3cWNrc3lRT0E1W